{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55710","headline":"春日登大悲阁二首（一字至七字） 一 · 钱惟治","name":"春日登大悲阁二首（一字至七字） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁，阁。\n雕镂，彩错。\n簇明霞，攅丽萼。\n玉女窥牖，飞仙捧铎。\n沉烟燠宝香，媚水涵珠箔。\n千山蓊郁晴霁，万井喧填晓郭。\n登临徙倚傍琼栏，满目春光煦寥廓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱惟治","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}